ghost-role-information-ashwalker-name = Ash Walker
ghost-role-information-ashwalker-description = You are a Lavaland Guardian. Lavaland's air is your air, so you need no internals. Guard the nest, feed it corpses of intruders, and protect the Necropolis.
ghost-role-information-ashwalker-rules =
    You are a [color={role-type-crew-aligned-alternate-color}][bold]Lavaland Guardian[/bold][/color]. Your job is to protect the Necropolis, your nest and your tribe.
    You must not fly to the station, visit the outpost, or attack players without reason. Breaking these rules is punishable by a ban.
    You don't remember any of your previous life, and you don't remember anything you learned as a ghost.
    You are allowed to remember knowledge about the game in general, such as how to cook, how to use objects, etc.
    You are absolutely [color=red]NOT[/color] allowed to remember, say, the name, appearance, etc. of your previous character.
ashwalker-nest-destroyed = The nest collapses in a burst of ash!
